# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:20
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_0e6c33e2:

    # k "Welcome, sir.{w} To your first proper day at the Academy." with d
    k "欢迎您，先生。{w}今天是在学院正式上班的第一天。" with d

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:22
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_10d9e66e:

    # mc "Well, I've had quite a day yesterday already, but I guess you mean that the 'training wheels' are off now?"
    mc "话说昨天我已经过了很充实的一天了，不过你的意思是，现在「辅助轮」已经卸下了吧？"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:24
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_1fb8be1e:

    # k "Precisely."
    k "正是如此。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:25
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_bfd387f0:

    # k "However, I'll give you a brief step-by-step on how you should take on the role of the Chief Academic Officer for our Academy."
    k "不过，我会为您简要介绍该如何担起本院教务主任的职责。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:26
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_74cd55e3:

    # k "And of course, on how to deal with our students."
    k "当然，也包括如何应对我们的学生。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:27
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_a0b70d8b:

    # k "First, as I'm sure you're well aware already, our main goal here is to make the Board happy.{w} So any action that you'd think would increase the satisfaction the Board has with our Program, would be one worth pursuing."
    k "第一，您想必已经很清楚，我们的首要目标是让理事会满意。{w}因此，凡是您认为能提升理事会对本项目满意度的行动，都值得去做。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:28
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_a60f1b5d:

    # k "Second, is that our 'Main Targets' are our most important assets, and you should try to maximize your interactions with them.{w} Doing so will make the Board and, our viewers, very interested in your performance."
    k "第二，我们的「主要目标」是最为重要的资产，您应该尽可能多地与她们互动。{w}这样做会让理事会以及我们的观众对您的表现非常感兴趣。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:29
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_e485cb9b:

    # k "And Third, is that, at least for now, we'll try to maintain a low profile and not alert the students as to what our real intentions are.{w} So a moderate amount of caution is advised, and we'll try to appear as a normal Academy."
    k "第三，至少目前我们要保持低调，不要让学生察觉到我们真正的意图。{w}所以建议保持适度的谨慎，尽量表现得像一所再普通不过的学院。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:31
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_46fe282c:

    # mc "Got it..."
    mc "明白了……"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:34
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_3268b60e:

    # k "Another important aspect is that, as the Chief Academic Officer, you'll have the ability to decide how our Academy will operate." with d
    k "另一个重要方面是：作为教务主任，您将有权决定学院的运营方式。" with d

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:35
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_450d7519:

    # k "I'm sure you're already somewhat familiar with its layout, but I suggest going over it again, and making the relevant decisions you want it to have an effect for the day, and/or the week."
    k "我相信您对界面已经大致熟悉了，但我建议再看一遍，并做出您希望当天、以及本周生效的相关决定。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:36
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_0ce045af:

    # k "One vital aspect that you should decide is the Weekly Exam Difficulty, as it'll have an impact on the one the students will be performing this Friday."
    k "您必须决定的一项重要事项是周考难度，因为它会影响本周五学生将要参加的那场考试。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:37
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_5bfa8ee8:

    # k "Easier exams will make the students happier and cause them to trust the Academy more, while Harder ones will make them struggle and have problems with their grades."
    k "简单的考试会让学生们更开心，也让她们更信任学院；而更难的考试则会让她们吃紧，成绩上也会出问题。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:38
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_46c6ceec:

    # k "Which could, in turn, make them susceptible to your... 'Manipulation'."
    k "而这反过来，可能让她们更容易被您的……「操控」。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:39
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_ea41ac8f:

    # k "Another interesting topic you should take notice are our 'Bounties'."
    k "另一个您应该留意的话题，是我们的「悬赏」。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:40
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_423c9176:

    # k "They are 'Side Objectives' which were given to us by our most prominent viewers."
    k "那是观众中最活跃的那批人交给我们的「支线目标」。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:41
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_fee2522f:

    # k "As the name suggest, there is a bounty for certain actions to be performed, and doing so, will grant the Academy some rewards in the form of more viewer engagement and Board Satisfaction, as well as other benefits."
    k "顾名思义，某些行动只要完成就会有悬赏。完成它们会让学院获得回报——更高的观众参与度与看板满意度，以及其他好处。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:42
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_cd229745:

    # k "Right now we have two available bounties..."
    k "目前有两个可用的悬赏……"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:43
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_a261e5b1:

    # k "One is for one of our female students to perform 'Oral Sex'."
    k "其中一个，是让我们的一名女学生进行「口交」。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:44
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_187ce066:

    # k "And the other is a special one...{w} Is for you to somehow acquire Miss [maiya.name]'s panties. So we can sell them to a bidder."
    k "另一个比较特别……{w}需要您想办法弄到 [maiya.name] 小姐的内裤，好让我们转卖给出价的人。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:46
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_ef2677b9:

    # mc "Interesting... So, having some girl suck me {i}and{/i} steal [ma]'s panties? Got it."
    mc "有意思……也就是说，让某个女孩给我口交，{i}而且{/i}还要偷走 [ma] 的内裤？明白了。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:48
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_1d413dce:

    # k "One important aspect to note is that the bounties specify whether you should be involved in the act or not." with d
    k "有一点需要特别注意：悬赏会注明您是否必须亲自参与。" with d

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:49
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_3a93637a:

    # k "In the case of the 'Oral Sex' one, the requirements are only that a female student performs the act with another male, not necessarily you."
    k "以「口交」那个为例，要求只是由一名女学生与另一名男性进行，并不一定是您。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:51
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_a59b2742:

    # mc "...But it can be me, right?"
    mc "……不过也可以是我，对吧？"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:53
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_80f91ba3:

    # k "Of course, sir."
    k "当然可以，先生。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:54
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_9e483a72:

    # k "You can take a look for yourself in the Academy Report Book to see more details on the available bounties."
    k "您可以在学院报告簿里自行查看可用悬赏的详细信息。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:55
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_7d4ace59:

    # k "Once you feel you're ready to begin the daily activities, press the 'Next Period' button, and we'll wait for the students to arrive."
    k "等您觉得可以开始当天的活动时，按下「下一时段」按钮，我们会等学生们到来。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:57
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_920bdb7b:

    # mc "Alright... Let's begin, then!"
    mc "好的……那么开始吧！"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:62
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Kiyomi_Explanation_6aa9624b:

    # centered "{b}Note:{/b} Some of the management features are still a work in progress and are meant to represent a concept of what those systems will look like in later stages of development." with d
    centered "{b}注意：{/b}部分经营功能仍在开发当中，仅用于展示这些系统在后续开发阶段大致的样子。" with d

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:78
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Player_Trying_to_Skip_5717d04b:

    # k "Sir, The students have already arrived and are following their daily routines." with d
    k "先生，学生们已经到校，正在按各自的日程行动。" with d

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:88
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Player_Trying_to_Skip_d46d3c01:

    # k "As you can see, there's an alert on your laptop. That is because there's a big amount of viewers concentrated on one of our cameras, which usually indicate that something interesting is going on at the Academy." with d
    k "如您所见，您的笔记本电脑上出现了一个提示。这是因为有大量观众集中在我们的一台摄像机上，通常意味着学院里正在发生有趣的事。" with d

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:89
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Player_Trying_to_Skip_3a11e77e:

    # k "Go to your laptop and interact with the camera indicated by an icon to see the event."
    k "请前往笔记本电脑，与带有图标标记的摄像机互动即可观看该事件。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:94
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Player_Trying_to_Skip_13daa8e2:

    # k "Sir, you shouldn't skip the first day" with d
    k "先生，您不该跳过第一天" with d

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:95
translate schinese MC_loop_intro_Player_Trying_to_Skip_3a11e77e_1:

    # k "Go to your laptop and interact with the camera indicated by an icon to see the event."
    k "请前往笔记本电脑，与带有图标标记的摄像机互动即可观看该事件。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:108
translate schinese BountyReminder_aadadd9f:

    # k "Sir. We have received new bounties from our viewers." with d
    k "先生，我们收到了观众们发来的新悬赏。" with d

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:109
translate schinese BountyReminder_7353e37f:

    # k "Please, make sure to take a look at our Academy Report Book to see the requirements needed for their completion."
    k "请务必查看学院报告簿，确认完成它们所需的条件。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:111
translate schinese BountyReminder_d4769b06:

    # mc "Got it, I'll take a look when I can."
    mc "明白，我会找时间看一下。"

# game/gameplayloop_introduction.rpy:113
translate schinese BountyReminder_f071b95b:

    # k "As you wish, sir. If you need anything else, don't hesitate to ask me."
    k "如您所愿，先生。如果还需要什么，请随时吩咐。"

